{"ticker":"Q","updated":"2026-11-27T23:17:16Z","profile":{"longName":"Qnity Electronics, Inc.","shortName":"Qnity Electronics, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"United States","website":"https://www.qnityelectronics.com","fullTimeEmployees":10000,"marketCap":23203813376,"trailingPE":41.72932,"forwardPE":18.539892,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.22656,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":173.3,"targetHighPrice":216.0,"targetLowPrice":150.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.219,"earningsGrowth":-0.137,"grossMargins":0.46922,"operatingMargins":0.22914,"profitMargins":0.10163999,"totalRevenue":5489999872,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":177.28,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":75.655,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.3},"summary":"Qnity Electronics, Inc. provides materials and solutions to the semiconductor and electronics industries in the United States, rest of Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Asia Pacific, China, South Korea, Taiwan, and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Semiconductor Technologies and Interconnect Solutions. Its Semiconductor Technologies segment offers chemical mechanical planarization (CMP) pads and slurries, photoresists, functional sub-layers, advanced overcoats, post-CMP cleaners, post-etch residue removers, and emerging cleans. The Interconnect Solutions segment provides copper pillar plating, copper redistribution layer, solder bump plating, under bump metallization, photoresists, packaging dielectrics, gap fillers, phase change, specialty thermal interface materials, thermally conductive insulators, copper plating solutions, dry film photoresists, and laminates and polyimide films. The company was formerly known as Novus SpinCo 1, Inc. and changed its name to Qnity Electronics, Inc. in April 2025. The company was incorporated in 2024 and is headquartered in Wilmington, Delaware.","summary_zh":"Qnity Electronics, Inc. 為美國、美洲其他地區、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區、中國、韓國、台灣和國際的半導體和電子產業提供材料和解決方案。該公司分為兩個部門：半導體技術部門和互連解決方案部門。其半導體技術部門提供化學機械平坦化 (CMP) 墊和漿料、光阻、功能子層、高級塗層、CMP 後清潔劑、蝕刻後殘留物去除劑和新興清潔劑。互連解決方案部門提供銅柱電鍍、銅再分佈層、焊料凸塊電鍍、凸塊下金屬化、光致抗蝕劑、封裝電介質、間隙填充物、相變、特種熱界面材料、導熱絕緣體、鍍銅解決方案、乾膜光致抗蝕劑以及層壓板和聚酰亞胺薄膜。該公司前身為 Novus SpinCo 1, Inc.，於 2025 年 4 月更名為 Qnity Electronics, Inc.。該公司成立於 2024 年，總部位於特拉華州威爾明頓。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體設備與材料","candles":[{"t":"2025-10-27","o":70.5,"h":101.52,"l":70.5,"c":95.3,"v":69700},{"t":"2025-10-28","o":99.01,"h":103.5,"l":93.01,"c":94.74,"v":172600},{"t":"2025-10-29","o":94.5,"h":96.89,"l":92.12,"c":94.04,"v":91700},{"t":"2025-10-30","o":94.1,"h":94.98,"l":91.675,"c":93.4,"v":122600},{"t":"2025-10-31","o":95.0,"h":95.98,"l":91.4,"c":95.0,"v":282500},{"t":"2025-11-03","o":98.0,"h":100.54,"l":95.0,"c":97.0,"v":10626200},{"t":"2025-11-04","o":99.5,"h":104.0,"l":97.8,"c":100.91,"v":6091300},{"t":"2025-11-05","o":105.01,"h":105.4,"l":93.38,"c":99.65,"v":7108500},{"t":"2025-11-06","o":100.0,"h":101.15,"l":93.33,"c":93.33,"v":4096200},{"t":"2025-11-07","o":92.16,"h":95.0,"l":88.681,"c":92.31,"v":3282800},{"t":"2025-11-10","o":94.93,"h":99.39,"l":93.6,"c":96.6,"v":3220400},{"t":"2025-11-11","o":98.45,"h":102.15,"l":95.5,"c":96.53,"v":2492600},{"t":"2025-11-12","o":96.67,"h":96.67,"l":91.25,"c":91.96,"v":2740700},{"t":"2025-11-13","o":91.5,"h":91.75,"l":84.82,"c":85.9,"v":3926100},{"t":"2025-11-14","o":84.15,"h":87.05,"l":81.621,"c":83.48,"v":2466200},{"t":"2025-11-17","o":81.63,"h":84.1,"l":79.2,"c":81.46,"v":2504600},{"t":"2025-11-18","o":79.5,"h":82.03,"l":78.01,"c":78.98,"v":3116500},{"t":"2025-11-19","o":79.13,"h":80.31,"l":75.72,"c":79.62,"v":3325400},{"t":"2025-11-20","o":82.01,"h":83.5,"l":74.5,"c":74.9,"v":3072500},{"t":"2025-11-21","o":74.97,"h":77.935,"l":73.22,"c":75.8,"v":2736100},{"t":"2025-11-24","o":76.34,"h":76.735,"l":72.81,"c":73.54,"v":5002100},{"t":"2025-11-25","o":73.0,"h":79.06,"l":72.94,"c":78.01,"v":3033500},{"t":"2025-11-26","o":77.95,"h":80.74,"l":